\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-tag h-3 w-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"vktsd0\",{\"d\":\"M12.586 2.586A2 2 0 0 0 11.172 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7.172a2 2 0 0 0 .586 1.414l8.704 8.704a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 3.42 0l6.58-6.58a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 0-3.42z\"}],[\"$\",\"circle\",\"kqv944\",{\"cx\":\"7.5\",\"cy\":\"7.5\",\"r\":\".5\",\"fill\":\"currentColor\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],\" Messaging Tips\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1cmpym\",{\"d\":\"M8 2v4\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"4m81vk\",{\"d\":\"M16 2v4\"}],[\"$\",\"rect\",\"1hopcy\",{\"width\":\"18\",\"height\":\"18\",\"x\":\"3\",\"y\":\"4\",\"rx\":\"2\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"8toen8\",{\"d\":\"M3 10h18\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],\" June 1, 2026\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-clock h-3 w-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"polyline\",\"68esgv\",{\"points\":\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],\" 7 min read\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight\",\"children\":[\"How to Create \",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary\",\"children\":\"Sweet AI Replies\"}],\" for Your Partner\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-lg md:text-xl text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\",\"children\":\"Whether you're stuck on what to say or just want to surprise your partner with something extra special, AI-powered messaging tools can help you craft the perfect reply.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white border border-[#d4c3ab] rounded-[32px] p-6 md:p-10 shadow-sm\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold\",\"children\":\"Why AI Messaging Works for Couples\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Communication is the foundation of every strong relationship. But sometimes — especially in long-distance relationships, or after a long day at work — finding the right words can feel impossible. That's where AI-assisted messaging tools come in. They are not about replacing genuine emotion; they are about helping you \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"express it better\"}],\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Think of an AI messaging prompt as a first draft. It gives you a starting point — a warm, thoughtful base — that you can then personalise with your own voice, inside jokes, and specific memories to make it truly yours.\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-8\",\"children\":\"Types of Messages Couples Use AI For\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold\",\"children\":\"1. Good Morning Messages\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Starting your partner's day with a sweet message sets a positive tone. AI prompts can help you go beyond a simple \\\"Good morning!\\\" to craft something that feels genuinely warm and thoughtful.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-muted/40 rounded-xl p-5 border border-border/50\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground mb-2\",\"children\":\"💡 Example Prompt Idea:\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground italic\",\"children\":\"\\\"Write a warm, 3-sentence good morning message for my girlfriend who loves coffee and sunsets. Make it feel genuine and cosy, not overly formal.\\\"\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-6\",\"children\":\"2. Apology Messages\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Sometimes we know we were wrong, but the words do not come easily. A well-crafted apology acknowledges the hurt, takes responsibility, and expresses genuine commitment to do better. AI can help structure this clearly and sincerely.\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-6\",\"children\":\"3. Anniversary and Special Occasion Messages\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Milestones matter. Whether it is a one-month anniversary, a year together, or a random Tuesday when you just want to express how much you love them, crafting a heartfelt message for a special occasion deserves special care. AI prompts can help you write something that genuinely captures the depth of your feelings.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Better yet, consider turning your anniversary message into a full\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"href\":\"/digital-greeting\",\"className\":\"text-primary hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Wishes Website\"}],\" \",\"— an interactive, animated, musical greeting page your partner will never forget.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-6\",\"children\":\"4. Compliments and Affirmations\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Studies in relationship psychology consistently show that verbal affirmations are one of the most important love languages. Regular, specific compliments — not just \\\"you look nice\\\" but something that references a specific quality or moment — have a measurable positive impact on relationship satisfaction.\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-6\",\"children\":\"5. Fun and Playful Texts\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Relationships thrive on humour and playfulness. A well-timed funny message or a witty joke can instantly brighten your partner's day. AI can help you brainstorm puns, playful teases, or cute little scenarios that make them laugh.\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10\",\"children\":\"Tips for Making AI Messages Feel Personal\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3 list-none pl-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-heart h-5 w-5 text-pink-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5 fill-pink-200\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"c3ymky\",{\"d\":\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Always edit the draft.\"}],\" Add their name, a shared memory, or a private inside joke. This transforms a generic AI response into something uniquely yours.\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-smile h-5 w-5 text-yellow-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"1y1vjs\",{\"d\":\"M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2\"}],[\"$\",\"line\",\"yxxnd0\",{\"x1\":\"9\",\"x2\":\"9.01\",\"y1\":\"9\",\"y2\":\"9\"}],[\"$\",\"line\",\"1p4y9e\",{\"x1\":\"15\",\"x2\":\"15.01\",\"y1\":\"9\",\"y2\":\"9\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Match your natural tone.\"}],\" If you normally communicate casually, do not send a formal, flowery AI message — it will feel off. Ask the AI to match your usual style.\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-message-circle h-5 w-5 text-blue-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"vv11sd\",{\"d\":\"M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Use it for ideas, not as a script.\"}],\" Let AI be your brainstorming partner, but always speak in your own voice when you send.\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10\",\"children\":\"How MsgReplier Can Help\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Our\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"href\":\"/prompt\",\"className\":\"text-primary hover:underline\",\"children\":\"AI Couple Prompts\"}],\" \",\"page is a curated library of creative prompts designed specifically for couples. Unlike generic AI tools, these prompts are crafted for couple photo ideas, romantic scenarios, and creative couple activities — all copyable in one click.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Combine AI messaging with our\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"href\":\"/love-space\",\"className\":\"text-primary hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Love-Space\"}],\" \",\"for a complete private couple experience: chat, play games, and send thoughtful messages — all in one private, no-login-required space.\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 text-center p-8 bg-pink-50 dark:bg-pink-950/20 rounded-2xl border border-pink-100 dark:border-pink-900/30\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\",\"children\":\"Ready to Connect?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground mb-6\",\"children\":\"Start a private Love-Space with your partner today — no login, no apps, just the two of you.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"href\":\"/love-space\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-heart mr-2 h-4 w-4 fill-white\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"c3ymky\",{\"d\":\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],\" Enter Love-Space\"],\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&_svg]:pointer-events-none [&_svg]:size-4 [&_svg]:shrink-0 hover:bg-primary/90 h-11 rounded-md px-8 bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-500 to-rose-600 text-white border-0\",\"ref\":null}]]}]]}]}]]}]]}],\"$undefined\",null,[\"$\",\"$L6\",null,{\"children\":[\"$L7\",\"$L8\",null]}]]}],{},null,false]},null,false]},null,false]},[[\"$\",\"div\",\"l\",{\"className\":\"min-h-screen bg-[#0a0a0a] antialiased\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"pt-16 pb-20 px-3 md:px-4 md:pt-28 md:pb-32 border-b border-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div